Well, I still play 3.0 NH., because we haven't loaded 3.1 yet.  So, I had
a great game started, found an uncursed luckstone to start off. :) Then, I
found a bag of holding. :) :)

Cleared out Angmassilik of all his gold from taking stuff up to him.

Got Excalibur blessed, +5 and rustproof. :) :) :)

Had an AC -5. So so, I know.

Some of the terrifying moments....found the hard way a cursed amulet of
strangulation. (small hint: wait until you're turning blue to pray to
your deity to help.

A Titanothere took me from 85 to 6 hit points in one round.  A scroll of
Genocide fixed his caboose real quick.

I killed a nurse and made the mistake of eating the corpse.  Hey, I was
hungry.

How did I die?  On level 15, I had summoned Yenogghu from the sacrifice of a
ratwere corpse.  He was two above me to the northwest.  I hit Y to move me
back up to the altar.  I never did catch the message "Really attack Yenogghu?"

You hit Yeenoghu!
Yeenoghu hits!  You are hit by a shower of missiles!

Ooops. :/

Oh well.....but this cloud has a silver lining. :)

 
